# Cloudflare Pages Caching & MIME Type Headers
/*.wasm
  Content-Type: application/wasm
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.js
  Content-Type: application/javascript
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
